dren":["2d6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.5 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Energy and Slashing\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Retrosaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Retrosaber","referenceId":"reference:e1a5736b1a0c920e"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Medium\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["4,000\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["2d8\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["0.8 kg\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Energy and Slashing\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["1: Can be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Thrown"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Thrown"}]}]},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Training Lightsabers"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["There are two effective ways to build a less lethal Lightsaber, sometimes known as a Training Lightsaber: using either a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bondar Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bondar_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:1c775656c4b7d7d1"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kathracite Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kathracite_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:a779e1c4a6eac949"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bondar Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bondar_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:1c775656c4b7d7d1"}," is used in the creation of the safest Lightsabers, given to younglings for basic weapon training in the Jedi Temple. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bondar Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bondar_Crystals"}," create wholly nonlethal Lightsabers that merely shock the target and do not actually cut into it. Typically, Lightsabers with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bondar Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bondar_Crystals"}," see use during sparring sessions between Padawans, as they allow the Jedi to actually strike the target with what would be a serious blow without permanent harm. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kathracite Crystals"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kathracite_Crystals?action=edit&redlink=1"},", on the other hand, produces a more traditional Lightsaber blade, albeit a weaker one that is less likely to cause serious harm in case of an accident.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["By the time an adventuring ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"}," begins their career, they have likely abandoned Training Lightsabers entirely and uses a full-strength ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lightsaber"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lightsaber","referenceId":"reference:987a817de9003439"},", albeit not one of their own creation. Lightsabers with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bondar Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bondar_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:1c775656c4b7d7d1"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kathracite Crystal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kathracite_Crystal","referenceId":"reference:a779e1c4a6eac949"}," usually appear in the hands of younglings, or are kept safely in reserve by the Jedi Temples and Academies for when new students come of age.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
